	"_about": "Elite Auto Dealer palette library: Aurelis (the fixed default) then 40 automotive palettes, grouped by family (Dark & metallic, Blue, Green & teal, Warm neutral, Red & copper, Light & silver, Distinctive); the order here is the Customizer order. Each palette lists its name, family, five card swatches (ink, graphite-2, accent, accent-light, paper) and its twelve base slots. bin/palette-build.php derives the helper slots (accent-ink, on-accent, field-line, accent-card, accent-muted, accent-focus), gates every tone and writes inc/palette-registry.php. Aurelis must equal eda_palette_aurelis() byte for byte. Edit here, then run: php bin/palette-build.php",
